Subject: [PATCH] test(test-quality): finish the slice's import-preamble
 conversion
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Converts the remaining seven sites across five modules, completing D4 over
the six slice directories: a grep for spec_from_file_location and
Path(__file__).parent.parent.parent now returns nothing there.

The two sibling-fixture loads (_execution_manifest_fixtures) become bare
imports, which is the tree's actual convention — 530 uses across 389 files.
Collapsing their two unique sys.modules registrations onto one shared module
is safe: that fixture module defines only a class and four factories, with no
module-level mutable state.

Marketplace-script loads keep their original registration names, as in the
previous commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
